Trademarks
================================================================================

miniDSP is a trademark of miniDSP Ltd. LiniDi is an independent project with
no affiliation to, sponsorship from, or endorsement by miniDSP Ltd. The name
appears here only to say which hardware this software talks to, which is what
it is for.

The project was called minidsp-gui while it was one person's utility. It was
renamed because a name built out of somebody else's is a poor thing to hand to
other people, whatever the intent behind it -- and because a project named
after the thing it plugs into cannot be found by anyone searching for it.

