Third-party components
================================================================================

minidsp-rs
    https://github.com/mrene/minidsp-rs
    Copyright Mathieu Rene and contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

    LiniDi communicates with `minidspd` (its HTTP API) and the `minidsp`
    CLI. Distributions that bundle those binaries redistribute minidsp-rs under
    the Apache License, Version 2.0; this NOTICE serves as the required
    attribution.

    The JSON files in `address_maps/` are generated by
    `tools/gen_address_map.py` from minidsp-rs's device definitions in
    `protocol/src/device/*.rs`, and are therefore derived from that project.

