    The build in dist/ was made against PySide6 6.11.2 (Qt 6.11.2) on
    Python 3.14, with pyusb 1.3.1. `./build.sh` prints these each time it
    runs, so the figure to publish is whatever it reported for the build
    being shipped rather than the one recorded here.

Filter design
    Biquad coefficient formulas follow the "Cookbook formulae for audio
    equalizer biquad filter coefficients" by Robert Bristow-Johnson, which the
    author placed in the public domain.
